      <https://w3id.org/iadopt/ont/Variable>;
    dct:description "How many elementary particles with 0 charge and a mass about equal to that of a proton there are, that are electropositive chemical elements characterised by ductility, malleability, luster, and conductance of heat and electricity  and  that are exerting influence or producing an effect";
